 "remarks": "Fantastic - 3 Bedrooms and 2 full Baths with Storage Unit included. A new wash and dryer to be installed. Renovated and modern 2024 living ! Harbor Point / South End - Quick walk to Stamford Train Station. Beautiful and large apartment. Master Bedroom with Brick exposed walls and private Master Bath. Plus 2 Large bedrooms with a shared bathroom. Kitchen: Custom cabinetry with quartz countertops. Stainless steel appliances (stove. refrigerator, dishwasher, microwave) Central A/C, Heat, LED lights, high ceilings, high efficiency furnaces. Assigned Parking Space included.. Walk to restaurants, shopping & trains station. Ready to move in and enjoy. Cats OK This is a fourth-floor walk up , no elevator. The rent price of $2,500 is reflective of this fact . Other units in this building rent for hundreds more.",
